<title>NORWAY: Vital 9-mo profits rise.</title>
<headline>Vital 9-mo profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>				(millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> After-tax result		  214	vs	 201</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of Norwegian life insurer is Vital Forsikring. It is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Den norske Bank (DnB), Norway's largest commercial bank.</p>
<p> Premiums due			2,999     vs     2,991</p>
<p> Gross financial income	  3,059     vs     3,229</p>
<p> Insurance payments		2,183     vs     2,186</p>
<p> Operating expenses		  350     vs	 365</p>
<p> Result for distribution	 1,075     vs     1,429</p>
<p> Transfers			     823     vs     1,179</p>
<p> Result of ordinary activity     252     vs	 250</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
